    "description": {
      "value": "<h2>Iron Nerves</h2><p><em>Panic is contagious. So is control.</em></p><hr /><h3>Rules</h3><p>When you roll Initiative (Intrigue), you gain temporary Integrity equal to your rank bonus.</p><p>Additionally, when you make a defense check against being Shaken or charmed, you may roll a d4 and add it to the save. Once you use this bonus, you can’t use it again until you finish a Scene Break or Soma Break.</p><p class=\"ft-engine-note\"><em>⚙ Rolling initiative grants temporary Integrity equal to your rank bonus. 🃏 Card — the +1d4, once per Scene Break.</em></p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
